      "explanation": "Subtracting a parenthesized difference changes the signs of both terms. Removing the parentheses therefore gives\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(20-2010+201)+(2010-201+20)\\\\\n&=20+20=\\boxed{40}.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\nThe \\(2010\\) terms cancel, as do the \\(201\\) terms. The answer is choice \\(\\mathrm{C}\\).",
